[ti:Everybody's Right]
[ar:Mippithedork]
[offset:-300]

[00:01.49]Three years of work, a dream come true
[00:06.26]A little game from me to you
[00:10.08]I made a trailer, hit upload
[00:13.48]And watched the comment section load!
[00:21.97]"THIS LOOKS AMAZING!"
[00:24.12]We're gonna be a hit!
[00:25.30]"Looks kinda boring."
[00:26.63]Oh God, this game is shit!
[00:28.89]"Is there multiplayer?"
[00:29.91]There really oughta be!
[00:31.66]"Please don't add multiplayer."
[00:32.96]I couldn't disagree!
[00:34.57]"I love the art style!"
[00:35.94]The art team nailed the look!
[00:37.20]"This looks like AI slop."
[00:38.72]Let's change the whole damn book!
[00:40.44]"Is this coming out on Switch?"
[00:42.14]We haven't thought that through!
[00:43.71]"Needs more dinosaurs."
[00:44.97]I THINK WE REALLY DO!
[00:47.22]One says yes,
[00:48.30]Another says no
[00:49.96]One says stop,
[00:51.54]Another says go
[00:53.28]A thousand voices in my head
[00:56.62]And every word is gospel said!
[01:01.73]EVERYBODY'S RIGHT!
[01:03.11]EVERYBODY'S WRONG!
[01:04.73]I CHANGE MY WHOLE DAMN GAME
[01:06.10]WITH EVERY COMMENT ON THE SONG!
[01:07.90]Five stars, one star,
[01:09.71]Tell me what to be!
[01:11.16]I'LL REBUILD THE WHOLE DAMN THING
[01:12.81]IF A STRANGER DISAGREES!
[01:14.76]I read it, I believe it!
[01:16.44]I panic, I repeat it!
[01:18.13]I don't know what I think tonight
[01:19.85]'CAUSE EVERYBODY'S RIGHT!
[01:24.66]"Day one purchase!"
[01:26.10]WE DON'T NEED TO TEST!
[01:27.96]"Looks like a cash grab."
[01:29.36]We should cancel the press!
[01:31.05]"The combat looks incredible!"
[01:32.62]Don't touch another thing!
[01:34.20]"That sword swing looks a little slow."
[01:36.01]REBUILD THE ANIMATION RIG!
[01:37.89]"I hope there's no microtransactions."
[01:39.49]We never had a store!
[01:40.84]"I'd pay for extra costumes."
[01:42.34]WE NEED A BATTLE PASS AND MORE!
[01:44.25]"What's the frame rate?"
[01:45.02]Sixty, guaranteed!
[01:46.67]"We haven't hit that yet."
[01:47.66]THEN WORK AT TWICE THE SPEED!
[01:51.11]One says yes,
[01:52.54]Another says no
[01:54.27]One says stop,
[01:55.79]Another says go
[01:57.52]We've got a date, we're almost there
[02:00.67]BUT SOME GUY HATES THE PLAYER'S HAIR!
[02:06.29]EVERYBODY'S RIGHT!
[02:07.30]EVERYBODY'S WRONG!
[02:08.93]I CHANGE MY WHOLE DAMN GAME
[02:10.65]WITH EVERY COMMENT ON THE SONG!
[02:12.11]Five stars, one star,
[02:13.88]Tell me what to be!
[02:15.42]I'LL REBUILD THE WHOLE DAMN THING
[02:16.93]IF A STRANGER DISAGREES!
[02:18.81]I read it, I believe it!
[02:20.46]I panic, I repeat it!
[02:22.18]I don't know what I think tonight
[02:23.86]'CAUSE EVERYBODY'S RIGHT!
[02:29.35]It's finally out...
[02:31.03]We shipped the game...
[02:32.67]The reviews are in...
[02:34.28]They know my name...
[02:36.34]"Ten out of ten, best game I've played!"
[02:38.42]I KNEW I WAS A GENIUS!
[02:40.57]"One star, didn't even launch."
[02:41.90]THAT GUY'S JUST BEING ENVIOUS!
[02:43.64]"Fun game, but it crashed six times."
[02:45.76]That's just a minor flaw!
[02:47.31]"Game sucks. Too many trees."
[02:48.96]REMOVE THE TREES! REMOVE THEM ALL!
[02:51.42]"Really loved the characters."
[02:52.84]Let's make a sequel now!
[02:54.49]"The tutorial is confusing."
[02:55.91]THEY DON'T KNOW HOW TO PLAY, SOMEHOW!
[02:57.70]"My cat walked on the keyboard."
[02:59.26]FIVE STARS! WE'RE DOING GREAT!
[03:01.00]"Refunded after twenty minutes."
[03:02.67]THIS PLAYER'S FULL OF HATE!
[03:04.66]"Great game!" "Dead game!"
[03:06.44]"Needs co-op!" "Needs a horse!"
[03:08.18]"Too expensive!" "Too much walking!"
[03:09.84]"Add a fishing minigame!"
[03:11.62]"Why is there no romance option?!"
[03:13.44]"Can you make the main character a sandwich?!"
[03:16.11]SOMEBODY JUST TELL ME WHAT TO DO!
[03:22.50]"Maybe stop reading every comment?"
[03:25.08]...That's the dumbest thing I've ever heard.
[03:29.11]EVERYBODY'S RIGHT!
[03:30.33]EVERYBODY'S WRONG!
[03:31.83]I'VE BEEN READING EVERY REVIEW
[03:33.19]FOR SEVENTEEN HOURS LONG!
[03:35.04]Five stars, one star,
[03:36.79]Tell me what to be!
[03:38.40]MY ENTIRE CREATIVE VISION
[03:40.40]IS A PUBLIC SURVEY!
[03:41.98]I read it, I believe it!
[03:43.43]Or angrily delete it!
[03:45.20]And if you don't agree with me
[03:46.94]THEN YOU'RE THE ENEMY!
[03:52.31]EVERYBODY'S RIGHT!
[03:54.80]EXCEPT THE ONES WHO DON'T AGREE!
[03:58.78]Well, that was a disaster.
[04:02.64]"Can't wait for your next game!"
[04:05.16]...They want a sequel?!
